<h2 id="santa-fe-kitchen-design-trends">Santa Fe Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Santa Fe kitchens balance deep Southwestern character with refined, contemporary detailing — warm woods, hand-finished surfaces, plaster-look palettes, and earthy tones that echo the city's adobe and Pueblo-revival architecture. The high-end market increasingly layers in handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> and <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> construction for a clean, modern counterpoint to traditional materials.</p>
